# PRock04b first input route (normal standalone start): PlayerStart to the tyroline
# mechanism and the mine-roof landing above the canyon.
# The start cave (14794.5,-4703.5,2411) opens east through four `prplamche02` plank
# movers (BreakAbleMover260/258/254/255 at x~15303..15316, y~-4694..-4765). They are
# broken by the ordinary fist attack (the route's only weapon at spawn) and the
# character walks into the walled yard south of the cabin.
# A gap in that yard's north fence at x~15800 lets the route pass; two more planks
# (BreakAbleMover19/16 at x~15743..16003, y~-3877..-3867) block the way and are
# broken the same way. The last plank (BreakAbleMover20, same wall) stands high
# enough to pass under while crouched (the measured crouch pass at x15800).
# The route then follows the open shelf north/east of the cabin to TyrolTrigger0
# (16754,-3644,2311), uses the named interaction (TryTyroling -> GoTyroling),
# and rides the tyroline to the far NavPoint. The ride releases the
# pawn on the high shelf above the PRmine_GR01 gallery roof at
# (18437.7,-3298.9,1359.9), alive and in PlayerWalking.
# The route stops there: the primary objective (the airplane at the canyon goal
# trigger) is still incomplete and the map's own DoTravel never runs. The next
# measured step is not input-safe in this standalone save: the shelf is ~1,200 UU
# above the canyon camp, and the tyroline release/roof slope carries the pawn
# west; the fall costs 114 HP (150 -> 36) and the unarmed player is then killed by
# the camp soldiers. See local/reports/item109-prock04b.md.
# No teleports, grants, goal writes or control overrides.
t=0.05 goto 15280 -4740
t=2 goto off
t=2 forward 0
t=2.1 engage BreakAbleMover260 500 4 period=0.4
t=5 engage BreakAbleMover258 500 4 period=0.4
t=8 engage BreakAbleMover254 500 4 period=0.4
t=11 engage BreakAbleMover255 500 4 period=0.4
t=14 goto 15500 -4740
t=17 goto 15780 -4700
t=20 goto 15800 -4500
t=23 goto 15800 -4200
t=26 goto 15800 -3913
t=29 engage BreakAbleMover19 600 6 period=0.4
t=35 engage BreakAbleMover16 600 6 period=0.4
t=41 crouch on
t=42 goto 15800 -3600
t=45 crouch off
t=46 goto 16100 -3550
t=49 goto 16500 -3550
t=52 goto 16700 -3600
t=55 goto 16754 -3644
t=60 use TyrolTrigger0
t=63 goto off
t=63 forward 0
